the form of a beautiful girl... these and countless other cryptic entities—called \"Ends\"—are driving us closer to the apocalypse. However, some youngsters decided to reject that fate and secretly took up arms.\n<br><br>\nThey are fighting, not to stop the countdown or to eradicate the threats, but only to delay the inevitable. Why would they choose such a thorny path on their own volition? To make the most out of their youth in this godforsaken world! I, a former cartel slave (and ESPer), have had a pretty shit life so far, to be honest. But maybe here I'll be able to lead a fulfilling school life, at least?\n<br><br>\n(Source: Kadokawa, translated)","duration":null,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"externalLinks":[{"language":"Japanese","site":"Twitter","type":"SOCIAL","url":"https://x.com/kcmt_official"}],"genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Sci-Fi","Supernatural"],"hashtag":"#こちまつ #こちまつ_anime","isLicensed":true,"meanScore":null,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[["ALTERNATIVE",194621,181572,"MANGA","MANGA"],["SOURCE",185573,196905,"MANGA","NOVEL"]],"season":null,"seasonYear":null,"source":"LIGHT_NOVEL","startDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":1,"score":10},{"amount":1,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":8,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":375,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":1,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":0,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":3,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[],"synonyms":["This Is the End Stagnation Committee.","こちまつ","Kochimatsu"],"title":{"english":null,"native":"こちら、終末停滞委員会。","romaji":"Kochira, Shuumatsu Teitai Iinkai."},"trailer":{"id":"X76MlPx2_1s","site":"youtube"},"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793696513},"65115":{"al":217785,"bannerImage":null,"coverImage":{"color":"#e4a11a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx217785-IaI9jn8IQYh0.jpg"},"description":"<i>“Here in Manchuria, the cheapest thing you'll find is a person's life.”</i>\n<br><br>\nIn 1937, Isamu Higata is sent to the Japan-controlled Chinese puppet state of Manchukuo to serve in its standing army. After losing sight in his right eye during battle, he's banished to an agricultural facility where he's constantly abused by the commanding officers. Then, in a dusty corner, he discovers a field of poppies, the raw materials for opium. In order to raise money for his seriously ill mother, Isamu decides to produce the illicit drug—a choice that sends his future and the fate of all Manchuria into directions unknown.\n<BR><BR>\n(Source: K MANGA)","duration":null,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"episodes":null,"externalLinks":[{"language":"Japanese","site":"Twitter","type":"SOCIAL","url":"https://x.com/manshu_ym"},{"language":"Japanese","site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"https://manshu-squad.com/"}],"genres":["Action","Mystery","Thriller"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":null,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[["SOURCE",117667,125732,"MANGA","MANGA"]],"season":null,"seasonYear":null,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":null,"month":null,"year":null},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":1,"score":10},{"amount":1,"score":80},{"amount":1,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":4,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":445,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":1,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":1,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":3,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[],"synonyms":["Manchuria Opium Squad"],"title":{"english":null,"native":"満州アヘンスクワッド","romaji":"Manshuu Ahen Squad"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793696509},"65116":{"al":217458,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/217458-3WdiqsAShqGK.jpg","coverImage":{"color":null,"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/